                                                "sense_id": "ab3b3097-31e3-3ff9-8c0c-12361bd86067",
                                                "text": "Mr. Blinken stressed that point on Monday. “The speaker will make her own decisions about whether or not to visit Taiwan,” he said. “Congress is an independent, coequal branch of government. The decision is entirely the speaker’s."
